
### Create a book rating
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "rating": 5
}

### Create a book comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "commentText": "I really enjoyed this book."
}

### Get comments for book 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/book/1
Accept: application/json

